m1	330,398,1512,843		The close of Handel's fugue And with his stripes we are healed from the Messiah: treble and bass staves with the signature of four flats, four bars, the duodenal [F.] above; the pure Doric cadence.
m2	190,1070,1655,1606		The close of the chorus Hear, Jacob's God from Samson: treble and bass staves, six bars, duodenal [A₁.] above, chords numbered [1 to 8] below, words Re-deem, re-deem, re-deem, O Lord, thy people; a purely Doric cadence.
